// The match file of the scenarios `ai_base`, `ai_noore` and `ai_boxed` (WP9.1b-1, docs/rules/ai.md): the
// AI builds its base on the first match's map. Player 0, Meridian, is the AI, with a construction centre
// where the human of `assets/matches/m1.ron` starts and 6000 credits; player 1, Veyran, is a lone static
// construction centre where the opponent of m1 has its own (a match needs two players). Read by
// sf_data::match_def like assets/matches/m1.ron.
//
// Slots: 0 the AI's construction centre (4 x 4, x 12..15, y 68..71), 1 player 1's centre (x 72..75,
// y 14..17), then what the AI builds, in the order it is placed.
(
    name: "ai_base",
    map: "m1",
    seed: 458758,
    players: [
        (
            id: 0,
            faction: Meridian,
            credits: 6000,
            objects: [
                (role: "construction_center", cell: (12, 68)),
            ],
        ),
        (
            id: 1,
            faction: Veyran,
            credits: 0,
            objects: [
                (role: "construction_center", cell: (72, 14)),
            ],
        ),
    ],
)
